477
00:28:51.020 --> 00:28:54.566
-Uh. that's Sammy number two.
-No.

478
00:28:54.607 --> 00:28:56.067
- Yeah.
- I'll explain it.

479
00:28:56.109 --> 00:28:58.695
There was a Sammy number one.
and then he died.

480
00:28:58.737 --> 00:29:00.113
Poor Samuel.

481
00:29:00.155 --> 00:29:02.157
-Halt. Who goes there?
-Whoa. whoa. whoa.

482
00:29:02.198 --> 00:29:04.993
Sor... Sorry.
My name is Woody.

483
00:29:05.118 --> 00:29:07.370
I come in peace.
Used to live here.

484
00:29:07.412 --> 00:29:08.455
All right.

485
00:29:09.706 --> 00:29:11.166
It's been too long. cowboy.

486
00:29:12.041 --> 00:29:13.918
-How've you been?
-Ah. busy.

487
00:29:13.960 --> 00:29:16.629
Came here as fast as I could
after Jessie called for help.

488
00:29:16.671 --> 00:29:19.007
-Good thing we were in town.
-She called you?

489
00:29:19.048 --> 00:29:20.925
-Yeah. I'm her deputy.
-But I'm her deputy.

490
00:29:21.593 --> 00:29:23.261
Uh...

491
00:29:23.303 --> 00:29:25.054
- That's odd.
- Well. well...

492
00:29:25.096 --> 00:29:26.681
there must be
a little mix-up here.

493
00:29:26.723 --> 00:29:28.641
-Well. no offense. Woody.
-Oh. none taken. None taken.

494
00:29:28.683 --> 00:29:29.851
But she literally

495
00:29:29.893 --> 00:29:31.561
-deputized me.
-Oh. is that so?

496
00:29:31.603 --> 00:29:33.188
-Woody. look. Eyes here.
-Uh-huh.

497
00:29:33.229 --> 00:29:35.356
-Star. Deputy. Me.
-Uh-huh.

498
00:29:35.398 --> 00:29:37.400
- No star.
- I got you.

499
00:29:37.442 --> 00:29:38.902
Star. No star.

500
00:29:38.985 --> 00:29:41.237
-Oh. hey. Buzz. what is that?
-What? Where?

501
00:29:41.821 --> 00:29:42.781
Ow.

502
00:29:42.822 --> 00:29:43.948
-Hey. Wait...
-What?

503
00:29:43.990 --> 00:29:45.784
Just happy to help. Deputy.

504
00:29:45.825 --> 00:29:49.287
Call me when
you're done helping. dear.

505
00:29:49.329 --> 00:29:50.497
Thanks. Bo.

506
00:29:50.538 --> 00:29:51.831
Okay. ladies.

507
00:29:51.873 --> 00:29:53.583
- Girls weekend!
- Yes.

508
00:29:53.625 --> 00:29:55.502
Un. deux. trois!

509
00:29:57.670 --> 00:29:59.047
Where is Jessie. anyway?

510
00:29:59.088 --> 00:30:00.840
Sleepover reconnaissance.

511
00:30:00.882 --> 00:30:02.550
Yeah. she and Bullseye are
helping Bonnie make friends.

512
00:30:02.592 --> 00:30:05.261
While fending off
the nefarious Lilypad.

513
00:30:05.303 --> 00:30:07.722
