Glasses.

514
00:30:07.764 --> 00:30:09.182
Didn't you always
have glasses?

515
00:30:09.224 --> 00:30:10.475
What? No.

516
00:30:10.517 --> 00:30:12.685
We've got it handled. cowboy.

517
00:30:12.727 --> 00:30:14.312
As her deputy. I'm certain

518
00:30:14.354 --> 00:30:16.606
