-Oh. my gosh. Yes!

687
00:38:15.918 --> 00:38:17.878
Mom brought us inside
after that tantrum Blaze had.

688
00:38:17.920 --> 00:38:19.463
and we never saw you again.

689
00:38:19.505 --> 00:38:21.090
