692
00:38:26.095 --> 00:38:27.471
Yeah. yeah. yeah.
Please do that. Yeah.

693
00:38:27.513 --> 00:38:29.682
Look at her!
She's so much older.

694
00:38:29.724 --> 00:38:31.267
-I know. right?
-She's adorable.

695
00:38:31.309 --> 00:38:33.060
-Isn't she?
-She got bangs that year.

696
00:38:33.102 --> 00:38:35.396
-Wait a minute. Where is that?
-That's Disneyland.

697
00:38:35.438 --> 00:38:36.605
Zoom in.
That's me in her pocket.

698
00:38:36.647 --> 00:38:38.524
Oh. flush.
You both went there?

699
00:38:38.566 --> 00:38:39.483
- Mm-hmm. For reals.
- It's so beautiful.

700
00:38:40.401 --> 00:38:42.278
And. uh.
that's the last of it.

701
00:38:42.320 --> 00:38:44.530
Next. it was just
a spinning rainbow wheel.

702
00:38:44.572 --> 00:38:46.073
