704
00:38:48.034 --> 00:38:49.785
- Wow.
- Aw.

705
00:38:49.827 --> 00:38:52.747
Okay. okay. I am glad you're
all powered up and stuff.

706
00:38:52.788 --> 00:38:54.749
but we're wasting time
I don't got.

707
00:38:54.790 --> 00:38:57.126
Oh. we're so grateful to you.
cowboy lady.

708
