And I gotta get us back
to our kid. Bonnie. now.

712
00:39:05.885 --> 00:39:08.095
She needs us.
So. where is he. Smarty?

713
00:39:08.137 --> 00:39:10.848
All right. okay. I said
I'd tell ya. so I'll tell ya.

714
00:39:10.890 --> 00:39:12.850
Drumroll please.

715
00:39:12.892 --> 00:39:15.811
He's probably in the bedroom.

716
00:39:15.853 --> 00:39:18.564
Probably in the bedroom?
I could've guessed that.

717
00:39:18.606 --> 00:39:20.858
-And yet. you did not. Dusty.
-Dusty?

718
00:39:20.900 --> 00:39:23.194
Yeah. you know. like ancient.
elderly. mummified old fart.

719
00:39:23.235 --> 00:39:25.529
Or as I like to call it.
number 1.5.

720
00:39:25.571 --> 00:39:26.739
I missed you. Smarty.

721
00:39:26.781 --> 00:39:28.407
You know what?

722
00:39:28.449 --> 00:39:30.242
-I've had enough of your cr--
-Oh. wait!

723
00:39:30.284 --> 00:39:32.203
I just had an idea that could
maybe help you get to Bonnie.

724
00:39:32.244 --> 00:39:34.538
- What?
- It's a little technical.

725
00:39:34.580 --> 00:39:36.123
but if the three
of us link up--

726
00:39:36.165 --> 00:39:38.959
No. no. I am done
with this techno mumbo jumbo.

727
00:39:39.001 --> 00:39:42.296
No offense. but I'll be fine
getting back on my own.

728
00:39:42.338 --> 00:39:43.631
Offense taken!

729
00:39:48.469 --> 00:39:50.638
You're muted. Dave.
You're muted.

730
00:39:50.679 --> 00:39:52.515
Okay. There you go.

731
00:39:52.556 --> 00:39:54.100
Only have a bit
of time left. One more time--

732
00:39:54.141 --> 00:39:55.351
You're muted again. Dave.

733
00:39:57.561 --> 00:39:59.021
Oh. cheese and crackers!

734
00:39:59.063 --> 00:40:00.815
What are you doing? Get back.

735
00:40:00.940 --> 00:40:02.900
You're not the only one
who misses their kid. okay?

736
