Hey. Mom!

740
00:40:10.658 --> 00:40:11.909
Back. back. back!

741
00:40:12.743 --> 00:40:14.703
Hey. Mom?

742
00:40:14.745 --> 00:40:17.164
-Wait a second. Is that...
-Is that big girl Blaze?

743
00:40:17.206 --> 00:40:19.542
-She's changed so much!
-Like overnight.

744
00:40:19.583 --> 00:40:21.419
- Is she here yet?
- Not yet.

745
00:40:21.460 --> 00:40:22.628
Why don't you
try messaging her?

746
00:40:22.670 --> 00:40:24.004
- Whoa.
- She big. big.

747
00:40:24.046 --> 00:40:25.840
She...

748
