She did it without me.

749
00:40:36.767 --> 00:40:38.144
Wow.

750
00:40:38.185 --> 00:40:39.562
-It's so pretty.
-It's so clean!

751
00:40:39.603 --> 00:40:40.813
When did she become neat?

752
00:40:40.855 --> 00:40:42.189
I can see the floor.

753
00:40:42.231 --> 00:40:43.774
I can see me in the floor.

754
00:40:43.816 --> 00:40:45.693
It smells like vanilla.

755
00:40:45.734 --> 00:40:47.361
With hints of brown sugar.

756
00:40:47.403 --> 00:40:48.571
You know who I don't miss?

757
00:40:48.612 --> 00:40:50.448
That stupid stuffed whale.

758
00:40:50.489 --> 00:40:51.615
- What was his name?
- Spouty.

759
00:40:51.657 --> 00:40:52.950
The worst.

760
00:40:52.992 --> 00:40:54.201
Give me a break.

761
00:40:54.243 --> 00:40:55.494
Annoying.

762
00:40:55.536 --> 00:40:58.414
Seriously.
how much have we missed?

763
00:40:58.456 --> 00:41:00.082
Everything.

764
00:41:00.124 --> 00:41:02.585
Your Blaze ain't the kid
you remember anymore.

765
00:41:02.626 --> 00:41:03.961
How would you know?

766
00:41:04.003 --> 00:41:07.173
I've seen
all this before.

767
00:41:07.214 --> 00:41:08.883
Spent a lot of years
under the bed

768
00:41:08.924 --> 00:41:11.719
watching my first kid
grow up without me.

769
00:41:13.804 --> 00:41:15.347
Hey. that's our address.

770
00:41:15.389 --> 00:41:17.558
How old is Blaze anyway?
Nine. ten?

771
00:41:17.600 --> 00:41:19.185
