thank you very much.

773
00:41:21.103 --> 00:41:23.856
It's 'cause you devices
make 'em change so fast.

774
00:41:23.898 --> 00:41:25.524
I gotta get back.

775
00:41:25.566 --> 00:41:27.443
So. where--

776
00:41:28.152 --> 00:41:30.488
Bullseye! Thank goodness.

777
00:41:31.530 --> 00:41:33.991
Uh-huh.
they seem nice. Bullseye.

778
00:41:34.033 --> 00:41:35.284
but we have to go now.

779
00:41:35.326 --> 00:41:36.994
Wait. wait. wait. wait.

780
00:41:37.036 --> 00:41:39.288
So you're saying that
this was your room too?

781
00:41:39.330 --> 00:41:41.040
- Yes.
- Really?

782
00:41:41.081 --> 00:41:43.083
What. you calling me a liar?

783
00:41:43.125 --> 00:41:44.168
No...

784
00:41:45.169 --> 00:41:46.795
Yeah. Yeah. liar.

785
00:41:49.882 --> 00:41:51.509
There's a knot in the ceiling.

786
00:41:51.550 --> 00:41:53.302
looks like an angry eye
when you squint at it.

787
00:41:53.344 --> 00:41:54.929
Window's got a small crack

788
00:41:54.970 --> 00:41:56.639
like a spider in
the upper right-hand corner.

789
00:41:56.680 --> 00:41:58.974
And out on that
tire swing hill.

790
00:41:59.016 --> 00:42:01.644
Emily and I would play
every summer afternoon.

791
00:42:01.685 --> 00:42:03.395
Now. Bullseye. let's go.

792
00:42:03.437 --> 00:42:05.356
Uh. you're welcome.

793
00:42:05.397 --> 00:42:08.526
For what? You didn't help me
at all. You were--

794
00:42:08.567 --> 00:42:10.945
What? Go on. Say it.

795
00:42:13.239 --> 00:42:14.990
Useless.

796
00:42:15.032 --> 00:42:16.575
-Oh. no. she didn't.
-Oh. snap!

797
00:42:18.536 --> 00:42:20.454
Oh. no. Not the pig!

798
00:42:27.753 --> 00:42:28.963
Jimmy got big.

799
00:42:30.256 --> 00:42:32.675
Lay it on me. Jimmy Dean!

800
00:42:32.716 --> 00:42:36.387
Who's coming? Sally's coming.
Who's coming? Sally's coming.

801
00:42:36.428 --> 00:42:40.099
Yeah. yeah. She's coming.
She's coming to my house.

802
00:42:41.141 --> 00:42:43.352
Hey. Mom!
Sally's texting me right now.

803
00:42:43.394 --> 00:42:44.770
She's probably on her way.

804
00:43:16.969 --> 00:43:20.639
You'll be my friend.
right. Jimmy?

805
00:43:25.561 --> 00:43:26.770
Always.

806
00:43:27.813 --> 00:43:32.651
By the way.
your hair looks so good today.

807
00:43:34.069 --> 00:43:35.321
Thank you. Jimmy.

808
00:43:38.574 --> 00:43:41.076
She's perfect!

809
00:43:42.536 --> 00:43:44.538
We gotta get Blaze
to meet Bonnie.

810
00:43:47.541 --> 00:43:48.584
Bonnie.

811
00:43:48.626 --> 00:43:49.710
Tag. you're it!

812
00:43:49.752 --> 00:43:50.919
We're home.

813
00:43:50.961 --> 00:43:52.963
Hi. hon.
How was the sleepover?

814
00:43:53.005 --> 00:43:54.256
I don't wanna talk about it.

815
00:43:54.298 --> 00:43:56.425
-Why? What happened?
-Nothing.

816
00:43:56.467 --> 00:43:57.676
That doesn't sound good.

817
00:43:57.718 --> 00:43:59.178
I don't see Jessie.

818
00:43:59.219 --> 00:44:00.304
Calm down. lover boy.

819
00:44:00.346 --> 00:44:01.513
Your fiancee's coming.

820
00:44:01.555 --> 00:44:02.890
Fiancee?

821
00:44:02.931 --> 00:44:05.225
Buzz Lightyear.
you never told me.

822
00:44:05.267 --> 00:44:08.437
I know. Isn't it exciting?
Well. it's not official yet.

823
00:44:08.479 --> 00:44:10.272
I have to. you know. ask her.

824
00:44:10.314 --> 00:44:12.232
Uh. FYI. I am ordained.

825
00:44:12.274 --> 00:44:14.109
-Since when?
-Last Halloween.

826
00:44:14.151 --> 00:44:15.819
Bonnie made me
a haunted priest. remember?

827
00:44:15.861 --> 00:44:17.154
- Oh. yeah.
- Guys. places.

828
00:44:17.196 --> 00:44:18.238
Bonnie's coming.

829
00:44:20.491 --> 00:44:21.909
Did you make some friends?

830
00:44:21.950 --> 00:44:22.993
I guess so.

831
00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:24.578
Aw. she looks awful.

832
00:44:24.620 --> 00:44:25.829
Does anyone see Jessie?

833
00:44:26.914 --> 00:44:28.499
So. that's Lilypad?

834
00:44:28.540 --> 00:44:30.209
How about I make you a snack?

835
00:44:30.250 --> 00:44:32.586
Yes. please. I'm starving.

836
00:44:32.628 --> 00:44:35.464
Jessie.
Jessie. Bullseye.

837
00:44:35.506 --> 00:44:36.757
-Where are you?
-Oh. no. oh. no.

838
00:44:36.799 --> 00:44:38.342
Is this not the right version?

839
00:44:38.384 --> 00:44:40.260
What? Where's Jessie?
Where's Bullseye?

840
00:44:40.302 --> 00:44:42.429
I'm a little busy
helping Bonnie right now.

841
00:44:42.471 --> 00:44:44.306
What on earth happened
at that sleepover?

842
00:44:44.348 --> 00:44:45.766
Excuse me. What are you?

843
00:44:45.808 --> 00:44:47.017
Are you like
some sort of old man toy?

844
00:44:47.059 --> 00:44:48.894
What?

845
00:44:48.936 --> 00:44:50.270
She thinks you're old
because you're bald. Woody.

846
00:44:50.312 --> 00:44:51.855
-Why. you little--
-Where's Jessie?

847
00:44:51.897 --> 00:44:54.024
What happened to Bonnie?
She looks miserable.

848
00:44:54.066 --> 00:44:55.776
Uh. the girls may have played
hide-and-seek

849
00:44:55.818 --> 00:44:57.778
and. um.
forgotten to find Bonnie.

850
00:44:57.820 --> 00:44:59.113
Poor Bonnie.

851
00:44:59.154 --> 00:45:00.364
How could you let that happen?

852
00:45:00.406 --> 00:45:02.700
I didn't. You toys did this!

853
00:45:02.741 --> 00:45:05.411
These girls have been
on The Pond for over a year.

854
00:45:05.452 --> 00:45:07.204
but Bonnie is behind

855
00:45:07.246 --> 00:45:09.164
because all of the time
she's been playing with you!

856
00:45:09.206 --> 00:45:10.791
I need to bring her
up to speed fast.

857
00:45:10.833 --> 00:45:12.668
starting with Turtle Tag.

858
00:45:12.710 --> 00:45:14.211
It's the quickest way for her
to connect with the girls.

859
00:45:14.253 --> 00:45:15.838
I'm only gonna ask
one more time. frog.

860
00:45:15.879 --> 00:45:17.089
Where is Jessie?

861
00:45:17.131 --> 00:45:18.507
Not my problem. I'm very busy.

862
00:45:18.549 --> 00:45:20.217
That's it.

863
00:45:20.259 --> 00:45:21.343
-We'll make her talk.
-I'll do it. Woody.

864
00:45:21.385 --> 00:45:22.761
Hey! Hey!

865
00:45:22.803 --> 00:45:24.263
-I got it. I'll--
-I got it. Buzz. No.

866
00:45:24.304 --> 00:45:25.556
- Back off. buddy.
- I got this. Ow!

867
00:45:25.597 --> 00:45:27.141
Do not touch me. Don't touch--

868
00:45:27.182 --> 00:45:28.434
Where's Jessie?

869
00:45:29.309 --> 00:45:31.895
Okay.
You toys are out of here.

870
00:45:33.355 --> 00:45:34.606
Wait.
She's doing something.

871
00:45:35.941 --> 00:45:38.277
So long. toys.

872
00:45:39.570 --> 00:45:41.238
-Turn her off!
-Turn her off!

873
00:45:41.280 --> 00:45:42.656
I can't! I can't!
It's not responding!

874
00:45:42.698 --> 00:45:43.741
I have plastic fingers!

875
00:45:43.782 --> 00:45:44.783
She's coming.

876
00:45:51.457 --> 00:45:52.958
You sure you want me
to take these toys?

877
00:45:53.000 --> 00:45:54.209
Mm-hmm.

878
00:45:54.251 --> 00:45:56.086
Okay. It's your room.

879
00:45:59.006 --> 00:46:00.758
No!

880
00:46:00.799 --> 00:46:02.134
They'll be in the garage
if you want them.

881
00:46:02.176 --> 00:46:03.218
Yep.

882
00:46:06.346 --> 00:46:09.600
I now
pronounce us in storage.

883
00:46:11.727 --> 00:46:14.104
Playing with you is fun.

884
00:46:16.857 --> 00:46:18.484
Okay. Now what do we d--

885
00:46:26.492 --> 00:46:29.119
Don't worry. Buzz.
We're gonna find her.

886
00:46:29.870 --> 00:46:30.871
I promise.

887
00:46:35.292 --> 00:46:38.712
Woody. I know it's just
a pretend ceremony.

888
00:46:38.754 --> 00:46:41.006
and Bonnie usually
decides these things. but...

889
00:46:42.216 --> 00:46:44.885
Well. if it were up to me.

890
00:46:46.094 --> 00:46:47.304
you'd be my best man.

891
00:46:49.056 --> 00:46:50.307
Buzz. I...

892
00:46:51.016 --> 00:46:52.643
I'd be honored.

893
00:46:52.684 --> 00:46:54.978
But Jessie
will never speak to me again

894
00:46:55.020 --> 00:46:57.689
now that I've let Lily
take charge of the room.

895
00:46:57.731 --> 00:46:59.316
Wait a min-- Take charge.

896
00:46:59.358 --> 00:47:01.151
-I tried to.
-No. no. no. Buzz. that's it.

897
00:47:01.276 --> 00:47:02.361
What is?

898
00:47:11.954 --> 00:47:13.413
Tomorrow morning.

899
00:47:13.455 --> 00:47:15.415
everyone will wake up
fully recharged...

900
00:47:16.333 --> 00:47:19.044
except Lilypad.

901
00:47:19.086 --> 00:47:22.506
And then we'll make Lily
tell us... Where's Jessie?

902
00:47:29.012 --> 00:47:30.722
Oh. finally.

903
00:47:35.853 --> 00:47:37.521
Psst. Hey.

904
00:47:37.563 --> 00:47:38.897
It's okay. Just ignore her.

905
00:47:38.939 --> 00:47:40.023
- Shh. shh.
- Quiet!

906
00:47:40.065 --> 00:47:42.109
Nobody's home.

907
00:47:42.150 --> 00:47:44.486
- I can hear you.
- Smarty!

908
00:47:44.528 --> 00:47:46.655
- What? I used a faraway voice.
- Come on. man!

909
00:47:46.697 --> 00:47:48.574
-Look. Camera--
-It's Snappy.

910
00:47:48.615 --> 00:47:50.033
Right. Snappy.

911
00:47:50.075 --> 00:47:51.535
You said there was
a way you could help us

912
00:47:51.577 --> 00:47:53.120
get to Bonnie. right?
So. what is it?

913
00:47:53.161 --> 00:47:55.163
She did say that. didn't she?

914
00:47:55.205 --> 00:47:56.915
That sounds. I don't know...

915
00:47:56.957 --> 00:47:59.126
- Useful?
- That's it. yeah.

916
00:47:59.167 --> 00:48:01.461
Too bad we're useless!

917
00:48:01.503 --> 00:48:03.630
- Right!
- Yeah! Remember?

918
00:48:06.174 --> 00:48:09.136
I'm sorry
I called you useless.

919
00:48:09.177 --> 00:48:13.891
You three
are definitely of use...

920
00:48:14.474 --> 00:48:15.350
somehow.

921
00:48:16.560 --> 00:48:18.395
- Worst apology ever.
- Just awful.

922
00:48:18.437 --> 00:48:20.564
Now I want
an apology for that apology.

923
00:48:22.316 --> 00:48:26.028
Please. I know I messed up.

924
00:48:26.069 --> 00:48:29.281
I was wrong
about your kid. Blaze.

925
00:48:29.323 --> 00:48:33.493
She's creative and silly

926
00:48:33.577 --> 00:48:36.246
in a way
other kids don't really get.

927
00:48:36.914 --> 00:48:38.332
Am I right?

928
00:48:47.215 --> 00:48:48.467
Go on.

929
00:48:49.217 --> 00:48:51.637
Well. our kid's like that too.

930
00:48:51.678 --> 00:48:54.056
And I think
they'd really like each other.

931
00:48:54.097 --> 00:48:56.475
So. fine.
if you don't want to help me.

932
00:48:56.516 --> 00:48:58.393
let's just help our kids.

933
00:48:59.686 --> 00:49:01.271
All right. twist my handle.

934
00:49:01.313 --> 00:49:02.814
Yeah! We're making friends.

935
00:49:02.856 --> 00:49:04.149
-F-R-E-N-D.
-With an "I."

936
00:49:04.191 --> 00:49:05.484
F-R-I-N-D.

937
00:49:05.525 --> 00:49:07.486
Great! So.
how do we connect them?

938
00:49:07.527 --> 00:49:10.405
You said your kid's device was
on The Pond like me. right?

939
00:49:10.447 --> 00:49:14.451
Right! So Smarty. Atlas and I
are all compatible. see?

940
00:49:14.493 --> 00:49:16.286
And I could take
a picture of you.

941
00:49:16.328 --> 00:49:18.455
-Okay. act like a toy.
-O-Okay.

942
00:49:20.290 --> 00:49:22.459
Uh. not very photogenic.
are they?

943
00:49:22.501 --> 00:49:24.044
-And Atlas can add text to it.
-Mm-hmm.

944
00:49:25.671 --> 00:49:27.631
- Then we post it on The Pond.
- Yep.

945
00:49:27.673 --> 00:49:28.757
Where Bonnie is!

946
00:49:28.799 --> 00:49:30.384
Ta-da!

947
00:49:30.425 --> 00:49:31.969
Great! So. you sent it?

948
00:49:32.010 --> 00:49:33.512
No. Still going.

949
00:49:37.099 --> 00:49:38.266
How about now?

950
00:49:38.308 --> 00:49:40.727
Still going.

951
00:49:40.769 --> 00:49:42.813
Still going?
How is that possible?

952
00:49:42.854 --> 00:49:44.898
Look at my eyes! The little
toilet roll's still spinning.

953
00:49:44.940 --> 00:49:46.566
I'm only as fast
as my operating system.

954
00:49:46.692 --> 00:49:48.652
So just slow your roll.
all right?

955
00:49:49.903 --> 00:49:51.488
There. It's sent.

956
00:49:51.530 --> 00:49:54.074
Finally. Now what?

957
00:49:54.116 --> 00:49:55.492
Now. we wait.

958
00:49:55.534 --> 00:49:57.035
Yeah. everyone's still asleep.

959
00:49:57.077 --> 00:49:58.578
We gotta wait for Bonnie
to wake up and see the post.

960
00:50:03.250 --> 00:50:05.877
Hey. I know!
We could play a game.

961
00:50:05.919 --> 00:50:06.795
-Yes!
-Yeah!

962
00:50:06.837 --> 00:50:07.838
-A game?
-Yeah!

963
00:50:07.879 --> 00:50:09.089
It was Blaze's favorite.

964
00:50:09.131 --> 00:50:10.757
It's called "Pick the Poop."

965
00:50:10.799 --> 00:50:12.009
You try and hit the button

966
00:50:12.050 --> 00:50:13.927
when the poop
shows up over it.

967
00:50:13.969 --> 00:50:15.220
Hey. Smarty.

968
00:50:16.054 --> 00:50:19.933
I will never play that game.

969
00:50:19.975 --> 00:50:23.186
They all say that.

970
00:50:27.941 --> 00:50:29.317
Come on!

971
00:50:29.359 --> 00:50:30.861
- It's my turn.
- Okay. you two.

972
00:50:30.902 --> 00:50:32.946
Time to stop playing
with your new toy.

973
00:50:32.988 --> 00:50:34.906
It's bedtime.

974
00:50:34.948 --> 00:50:36.992
-Already?
-Do we have to?

975
00:50:37.034 --> 00:50:38.827
Yeah. come on.

976
00:51:13.695 --> 00:51:14.905
Huh?

977
00:51:24.122 --> 00:51:29.294
"And they had splendid
games together. in whispers.

978
00:51:29.336 --> 00:51:32.214
when Nana had gone away
to her supper

979
00:51:32.255 --> 00:51:34.007
and left
the night-light burning

980
00:51:34.049 --> 00:51:36.176
on the mantelpiece.

981
00:51:36.218 --> 00:51:39.429
And when the boy
dropped off to sleep.

982
00:51:39.471 --> 00:51:43.809
the rabbit would
snuggle down close under

983
00:51:43.850 --> 00:51:45.393
his little. warm chin..."

984
00:51:45.435 --> 00:51:46.895
Sir.

985
00:51:46.937 --> 00:51:50.065
"...and dream
with the boy's hands

986
00:51:50.107 --> 00:51:53.652
clasped close
round him all night."

987
00:51:59.908 --> 00:52:01.201
Hmm.

988
00:52:02.369 --> 00:52:04.621
- Star Command.
- Star Command.

989
00:52:04.663 --> 00:52:06.081
-Star Command.
-Star Command.

990
00:52:12.546 --> 00:52:14.756
Star Command.

991
00:52:24.141 --> 00:52:25.433
What? No. no. no!

992
00:52:25.475 --> 00:52:27.018
Dad! Dad!

993
00:52:27.060 --> 00:52:28.770
What? What is it?

994
00:52:28.812 --> 00:52:30.605
Lily's not working!
I'm missing Turtle Tag!

995
00:52:30.647 --> 00:52:32.941
Kara. Chelsea and Heidi
play it every morning.

996
00:52:32.983 --> 00:52:35.152
-I can't miss it. Dad!
-It's okay.

997
00:52:35.193 --> 00:52:36.528
I plugged it back in.

998
00:52:36.570 --> 00:52:38.196
We just need to wait
for it to charge.

999
00:52:38.238 --> 00:52:39.865
But it's not okay!
I'm gonna miss the game!

1000
00:52:39.906 --> 00:52:41.950
Sweetie. there's nothing
we can do for now.

1001
00:52:43.910 --> 00:52:46.496
Aha! Success. huh?
Look at that.

1002
00:52:46.538 --> 00:52:47.831
That's phase one.

1003
00:52:47.873 --> 00:52:49.791
-And now. phase two.
-Phase two.

1004
00:52:49.833 --> 00:52:51.543
Well. I thought I was gonna
initiate phase two.

1005
00:52:51.585 --> 00:52:53.920
I initiate phase two.
We thumb wrestled over this.

1006
00:52:53.962 --> 00:52:55.505
All right. fine.

1007
00:52:55.547 --> 00:52:57.716
And then we'll have
a little talk

1008
00:52:57.757 --> 00:52:59.509
with our froggy friend.

1009
00:53:05.223 --> 00:53:07.976
-One. two. one. two. two...
-I hate this game.

1010
00:53:08.018 --> 00:53:09.728
-...one. two. one...
-Please make it stop.

1011
00:53:11.146 --> 00:53:12.939
Mighty Wiper!

1012
00:53:12.981 --> 00:53:15.025
-Again. again. again!
-I think you need a break.

1013
00:53:15.066 --> 00:53:16.985
I can't feel my buttons.

1014
00:53:17.027 --> 00:53:19.404
-Just one more time! Come on!
-That's enough play for now.

1015
00:53:19.446 --> 00:53:21.072
Play?

1016
00:53:21.114 --> 00:53:22.532
That's just a game.
That's not playing.

1017
00:53:22.574 --> 00:53:23.533
What's the difference?

1018
00:53:23.575 --> 00:53:25.076
You know. real play.

1019
00:53:26.745 --> 00:53:28.288
You're kidding. right?

1020
00:53:28.330 --> 00:53:30.207
You've never seen Blaze
play with a toy?

1021
00:53:31.541 --> 00:53:32.876
How long
were you guys with her?

1022
00:53:32.918 --> 00:53:33.960
-Three months.
-Ten months.

1023
00:53:34.002 --> 00:53:35.045
-Six months.
-Months?

1024
00:53:35.086 --> 00:53:36.755
What? Too long?

1025
00:53:36.796 --> 00:53:39.174
Too short!
Guys. you missed all the fun!

1026
00:53:39.216 --> 00:53:40.383
Hey. we're fun.

1027
00:53:40.425 --> 00:53:43.011
I mean fun. fun.
Make-believe fun.

1028
00:53:47.349 --> 00:53:48.725
Just look at her.

1029
00:53:51.353 --> 00:53:53.355
Oh. yeah. She plays.

1030
00:53:53.396 --> 00:53:55.565
Oh. yeah? Prove it.

1031
00:53:55.607 --> 00:53:59.069
Okay. Smarty Pants. We will.

1032
00:54:05.992 --> 00:54:07.369
Morning. Jimmy.

1033
00:54:08.495 --> 00:54:11.122
Ready for breakfast? Hmm?

1034
00:54:15.710 --> 00:54:17.170
Whoa.

1035
00:54:17.212 --> 00:54:19.923
Hey. Mom!
Where'd you find the cowgirl?

1036
00:54:21.675 --> 00:54:23.218
I ain't afraid
of nothin'. partner.

1037
00:54:23.260 --> 00:54:26.388
Yeehaw! Let's play!

1038
00:54:28.348 --> 00:54:29.641
Yeah.

1039
00:54:32.852 --> 00:54:34.479
Wait a minute.

1040
00:54:36.898 --> 00:54:38.191
Hmm.

1041
00:54:38.233 --> 00:54:39.276
Neigh!

1042
00:54:39.317 --> 00:54:40.986
Well. flush me.

1043
00:54:41.027 --> 00:54:43.029
Blaze is actually gonna play.

1044
00:54:43.071 --> 00:54:45.782
Here we go!

1045
00:54:48.493 --> 00:54:49.786
M'la--

1046
00:54:51.413 --> 00:54:53.665
M'lady Davenport.

1047
00:54:54.708 --> 00:54:57.335
I present Her Royal Highness.

1048
00:54:57.377 --> 00:54:59.504
Jimmy Queen.

1049
00:55:01.172 --> 00:55:04.301
Your Highness. how kind of you

1050
00:55:04.342 --> 00:55:05.969
to invite me
to your royal ball--

1051
00:55:08.513 --> 00:55:10.765
Jimmy!
This is your big moment.

1052
00:55:14.436 --> 00:55:16.229
What you got there. Jimmy?

1053
00:55:17.689 --> 00:55:19.482
Whoa.

1054
00:55:20.650 --> 00:55:22.861
I can't believe
I still have these.

1055
00:55:23.653 --> 00:55:25.613
Wait a minute.

1056
00:55:30.076 --> 00:55:31.536
Agent Clydesdale.

1057
00:55:31.578 --> 00:55:33.079
your suitor
is approaching now.

1058
00:55:34.456 --> 00:55:37.334
So. we meet again.
Agent Sheet-land.

1059
00:55:37.375 --> 00:55:39.002
It's pronounced Shet-land.
"Shet."

1060
00:55:39.044 --> 00:55:40.420
That's what I said.

1061
00:55:40.462 --> 00:55:42.172
Well. Agent Clydesdale.
or should I say.

1062
00:55:42.213 --> 00:55:44.507
Lady Davenport.
have you spotted it yet?

1063
00:55:44.549 --> 00:55:45.800
You mean. the bomb?

1064
00:55:45.842 --> 00:55:47.218
Yes! Shh! Quiet!

1065
00:55:47.260 --> 00:55:48.762
Snappy.
do you have eyes on it?

1066
00:55:48.803 --> 00:55:50.638
Not yet. Atlas. do you copy?

1067
00:55:52.098 --> 00:55:54.309
Agents! The bomb
is right on top of you!

1068
00:55:54.351 --> 00:55:56.728
Where? Where?

1069
00:55:58.229 --> 00:56:01.441
Where you never suspected.
Agent Clydesdale!

1070
00:56:07.238 --> 00:56:09.449
But where is the bomb?

1071
00:56:18.166 --> 00:56:19.626
She's coming to. Buzz.

1072
00:56:20.794 --> 00:56:21.795
Hurry it up.

1073
00:56:21.836 --> 00:56:23.296
I'm trying. Woody!

1074
00:56:23.338 --> 00:56:25.924
What... What happened?

1075
00:56:25.965 --> 00:56:28.385
Wait. What did you do
to my battery?

1076
00:56:28.426 --> 00:56:29.844
What we'll do again
if you don't tell us

1077
00:56:29.886 --> 00:56:31.429
what happened
to Jessie and Bullseye.

1078
00:56:31.471 --> 00:56:33.306
What time is it?

1079
00:56:33.348 --> 00:56:35.225
Oh. no! This is not good.

1080
00:56:35.266 --> 00:56:37.727
The girls got a head start
on Turtle Tag without Bonnie!

1081
00:56:37.769 --> 00:56:39.979
There's been one. two.
three inside jokes already.

1082
00:56:40.021 --> 00:56:41.898
This is a disaster!

1083
00:56:41.940 --> 00:56:43.525
Enough with the silly games.
Where's Jessie and Bullseye?

1084
00:56:43.566 --> 00:56:46.403
Silly? This is serious.
Stuffalo Bill!

1085
00:56:46.444 --> 00:56:47.821
Bonnie is missing out.

1086
00:56:47.862 --> 00:56:49.197
Stuffalo Bill?

1087
00:56:49.239 --> 00:56:50.907
Want her to make friends?
This is how!

1088
00:56:50.949 --> 00:56:53.034
Now keep your little
plastic hands away from me

1089
00:56:53.076 --> 00:56:55.036
or I will set off my alarm.

1090
00:56:55.078 --> 00:56:56.496
I thought you'd say as much.

1091
00:56:56.538 --> 00:56:58.832
Buzz. bring in "Sammy Two."

1092
00:56:58.873 --> 00:57:01.793
No. No. Absolutely not.

1093
00:57:02.710 --> 00:57:04.129
Oh. no. no. no--

1094
00:57:04.170 --> 00:57:05.588
Yes.

1095
00:57:05.630 --> 00:57:07.340
-Okay. try "settings."
-You mean this?

1096
00:57:07.382 --> 00:57:09.676
-That's a gear symbol.
-Okay. got it. Now what?

1097
00:57:09.717 --> 00:57:10.760
Reduce her screen time
to zero.

1098
00:57:11.719 --> 00:57:12.804
The shortest is an hour.

1099
00:57:14.431 --> 00:57:16.057
-What?
-"Horse grill"? Who is that?

1100
00:57:16.099 --> 00:57:18.017
"Horse girl."

1101
00:57:18.059 --> 00:57:20.019
- She's talking about Jessie.
- Well. then open it.

1102
00:57:20.061 --> 00:57:21.354
Whoa!

1103
00:57:22.772 --> 00:57:25.024
My hips.

1104
00:57:25.066 --> 00:57:26.734
Enjoy the garage. suckers!

1105
00:57:26.776 --> 00:57:28.111
-No. no. no! Lily!
-Wait. Hey!

1106
00:57:29.154 --> 00:57:30.363
Yes. can I help you?

1107
00:57:31.072 --> 00:57:32.449
Huh?

1108
00:57:32.490 --> 00:57:34.492
- Wait a minute.
- Fascinating.

1109
00:57:34.534 --> 00:57:37.203
Lily. bring back
that "horse girl" post.

1110
00:57:38.496 --> 00:57:39.706
Okay.

1111
00:57:39.747 --> 00:57:42.750
Oh. she has to do
what you say.

1112
00:57:45.044 --> 00:57:46.379
-She's getting away. Buzz!
-Lily!

1113
00:57:46.421 --> 00:57:47.839
-Hey. Lily!
-Hey. stop her!

1114
00:57:47.881 --> 00:57:49.007
-Hey. Lily!
- Yes?

1115
00:57:49.048 --> 00:57:50.884
-Open that post!
- Okay!

1116
00:57:50.925 --> 00:57:52.969
- Jessie.
- Bonnie's gotta see this.

1117
00:57:53.011 --> 00:57:55.013
Show her again.
Where is she? Hey. Lily.

1118
00:57:55.054 --> 00:57:56.389
-Hey. Lily!
- Yes?

1119
00:57:56.431 --> 00:57:57.682
-Show the post.
- Can I help you?

1120
00:57:57.724 --> 00:57:58.725
-Share it everywhere!
-Share!

1121
00:57:58.766 --> 00:57:58.933
- Yes!
-Share!

1122
00:57:59.893 --> 00:58:00.935
We did it!

1123
00:58:00.977 --> 00:58:02.020
So. where did it go?

1124
00:58:02.061 --> 00:58:03.104
Lily...

1125
00:58:09.736 --> 00:58:11.779
The printer! Yes!

1126
00:58:11.821 --> 00:58:13.406
Okay. I'm done.

1127
00:58:13.448 --> 00:58:14.741
Bonnie. you haven't
finished your breakfast.

1128
00:58:14.782 --> 00:58:15.909
No. I'm done.

1129
00:58:17.410 --> 00:58:20.288
I'm missing Turtle Tag. Mom.
They're playing without me.

1130
00:58:22.916 --> 00:58:24.292
Now what. Deputy?

1131
00:58:24.334 --> 00:58:26.044
Well.
you're the deputy. Deputy.

1132
00:58:28.505 --> 00:58:30.215
What's this all about. Bonnie?

1133
00:58:32.091 --> 00:58:34.052
Huh?

1134
00:58:37.138 --> 00:58:39.182
So. why did you put her toys
in the garage?

1135
00:58:39.224 --> 00:58:41.226
Uh. because Bonnie
asked me to.

1136
00:58:41.267 --> 00:58:43.311
-Remember. sweetie?
-No.

1137
00:58:43.353 --> 00:58:45.188
Well. I don't think
Lilypad texted me.

1138
00:58:45.230 --> 00:58:48.650
They're gone. She really does
have Jessie and Bullseye.

1139
00:58:48.691 --> 00:58:50.360
I hope they're okay.

1140
00:58:50.401 --> 00:58:52.070
Okay. we've gotten
the queen to safety.

1141
00:58:52.111 --> 00:58:54.781
Yes. You can do this.
Agent Clydesdale.

1142
00:58:54.822 --> 00:58:56.449
One of these buttons
defuses the bomb.

1143
00:58:56.491 --> 00:58:58.451
But which one.
Agent "Sheetland"?

1144
00:58:58.493 --> 00:59:00.620
"Shet"! It's "Shet"!

1145
00:59:05.792 --> 00:59:07.794
Boom!

1146
00:59:07.835 --> 00:59:10.964
Oh. no!

1147
00:59:11.005 --> 00:59:13.633
Blaze! Hon!
It's time to feed Daffodil.

1148
00:59:13.675 --> 00:59:15.718
Okay!

1149
00:59:15.760 --> 00:59:17.637
Come on. Your Majesty.

1150
00:59:18.638 --> 00:59:19.973
Thanks. babe!

1151
00:59:22.684 --> 00:59:24.435
- Holy cow! Wow!
- That was so cool!

1152
00:59:24.477 --> 00:59:26.771
-I was a spy! What?
-Yeah. you were!

1153
00:59:26.813 --> 00:59:28.064
-You were the best spy!
-Wow.

1154
00:59:29.732 --> 00:59:31.859
Smarty?

1155
00:59:31.901 --> 00:59:34.529
That was so beautiful.

1156
00:59:34.571 --> 00:59:37.365
That. my friend. was playin'.

1157
00:59:37.407 --> 00:59:39.909
-Oh. boy. did we.
-I feel so alive!

1158
00:59:39.951 --> 00:59:41.911
Is that what being
a toy is like. Sheriff?

1159
00:59:41.953 --> 00:59:43.955
Well. yeah. it's...
Wait. hold up.

1160
00:59:43.997 --> 00:59:46.749
You never called me
sheriff before in a nice way.

1161
00:59:46.791 --> 00:59:48.167
But. well. now I get it.

1162
00:59:48.209 --> 00:59:50.420
Blaze really is perfect
for Bonnie.

1163
00:59:50.461 --> 00:59:52.672
Playing with her
feels just the same.

1164
00:59:52.714 --> 00:59:55.174
Your kid plays like that too?

1165
00:59:57.927 --> 00:59:59.137
It's her!

1166
00:59:59.178 --> 01:00:00.888
She saw the post! It's Bonnie!

1167
01:00:00.930 --> 01:00:02.390
-Go on! Do it.
-Text her back.

1168
01:00:02.432 --> 01:00:03.975
-Go on.
-Text her back.

1169
01:00:04.017 --> 01:00:06.728
Text her back! Text her back.

1170
01:00:06.769 --> 01:00:09.105
Okay. okay. how do I do that?

1171
01:00:24.912 --> 01:00:28.041
What? Oh. yes!

1172
01:00:28.082 --> 01:00:29.917
-All right!
-She's coming.

1173
01:00:29.959 --> 01:00:32.253
- Bonnie's coming here.
- I knew she would.

1174
01:00:32.295 --> 01:00:34.505
Blaze and Bonnie
are gonna meet.

1175
01:00:34.547 --> 01:00:36.466
Smarty. what are you typing?

1176
01:00:36.507 --> 01:00:38.468
-Delete that right now.
-What?

1177
01:00:38.509 --> 01:00:40.720
I'm just trying to get some
batteries out of the deal.

1178
01:00:42.055 --> 01:00:43.348
So. what's going on?

1179
01:00:43.389 --> 01:00:44.891
Slink. talk to me.

1180
01:00:44.932 --> 01:00:46.809
Hard to hear.
A lot of commotion.

1181
01:00:46.851 --> 01:00:48.603
I bet they're arguing over
getting rid of us.

1182
01:00:48.645 --> 01:00:50.563
Are we getting donated?

1183
01:00:50.605 --> 01:00:53.691
-Mmm. Doughnuts.
-No. sweetie. Donated.

1184
01:00:53.816 --> 01:00:55.818
Wow. I love her.
but this is gonna be hard.

1185
01:00:55.860 --> 01:00:58.946
Shh! Quiet! I hear something.
Like tiny footsteps.

1186
01:00:58.988 --> 01:01:00.907
Aw. Kind of cute.

1187
01:01:02.200 --> 01:01:03.826
-Look out!
-Bonnie's coming!

1188
01:01:06.496 --> 01:01:07.830
Come on. Mom.

1189
01:01:07.872 --> 01:01:09.707
Oh. no. Lily's going too.

1190
01:01:09.749 --> 01:01:11.250
Hold on.
Bonnie. I'm sure your toys

1191
01:01:11.292 --> 01:01:12.752
aren't going to run off
on their own.

1192
01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:14.504
All right. Buzz.
you've gotta stay here.

1193
01:01:14.545 --> 01:01:16.047
-I'm going with them.
-Why? Why just you?

1194
01:01:16.089 --> 01:01:16.798
Look. I just have more
field experience than you.

1195
01:01:16.839 --> 01:01:17.590
That is all.

1196
01:01:18.341 --> 01:01:19.967
You don't think I can do it.

1197
01:01:20.009 --> 01:01:21.928
No. I just think I can do it
a little bit...

1198
01:01:21.969 --> 01:01:24.180
...better.

1199
01:01:24.222 --> 01:01:26.391
You don't deserve this.

1200
01:01:26.432 --> 01:01:28.601
-Buzz. come on. I was only--
-Jessie put me in charge.

1201
01:01:28.643 --> 01:01:30.853
Which is why you should
stay here and watch the room.

1202
01:01:30.895 --> 01:01:32.647
There is no room
without Jessie.

1203
01:01:32.689 --> 01:01:34.565
Buzz. no!

1204
01:01:43.991 --> 01:01:46.369
Nice poncho.

1205
01:01:46.411 --> 01:01:48.413
It's good
to see them fighting again.

1206
01:01:48.454 --> 01:01:49.664
It sure is.

1207
01:01:56.921 --> 01:01:59.090
How did your toys get
all the way out here?

1208
01:02:23.865 --> 01:02:27.034
Oh. how 'bout this one?
Ah. look at those puppies.

1209
01:02:27.076 --> 01:02:28.703
I'm saving that one.

1210
01:02:28.745 --> 01:02:30.621
Yeah. they came with the
latest update this morning.

1211
01:02:30.663 --> 01:02:31.914
I know. It never gets old.

1212
01:02:31.956 --> 01:02:33.207
She's here.

1213
01:02:33.249 --> 01:02:35.209
Careful. Snappy.
Dad might see you.

1214
01:02:35.251 --> 01:02:37.920
No way. He'll be showing off
those new backgrounds forever.

1215
01:02:37.962 --> 01:02:40.465
That's her!
That's Bonnie!

1216
01:02:40.506 --> 01:02:43.092
Bullseye. she's really here!

1217
01:02:44.343 --> 01:02:46.095
Bonnie. come on. let's go.

1218
01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:54.312
Buzz. listen.
I really just...

1219
01:02:58.065 --> 01:02:59.358
Aw.

1220
01:02:59.400 --> 01:03:01.027
It was nothing.
It was nothing.

1221
01:03:01.068 --> 01:03:04.113
Thanks. fellas.
Pretty glad I met you devices.

1222
01:03:04.155 --> 01:03:06.407
Ah. don't be dumping us
something you can't flush.

1223
01:03:06.449 --> 01:03:08.534
It's her!

1224
01:03:10.828 --> 01:03:12.455
Hello. Can I help you?

1225
01:03:12.497 --> 01:03:14.916
Hi. I'm so sorry
to bother you.

1226
01:03:14.957 --> 01:03:17.001
but we got this message
from your daughter.

1227
01:03:17.043 --> 01:03:19.462
She seems to have found
my daughter's toys.

1228
01:03:19.504 --> 01:03:21.047
- Are they in there?
- Oh. okay.

1229
01:03:21.088 --> 01:03:22.423
I'll have her get 'em.

1230
01:03:22.465 --> 01:03:24.342
- Blaze! Honey?
- Yeah?

1231
01:03:24.383 --> 01:03:26.803
Can you bring down
those two rag dolls you found?

1232
01:03:26.844 --> 01:03:29.096
- Their owner's here.
- Okay!

1233
01:03:29.138 --> 01:03:31.474
That's our cue.

1234
01:03:42.235 --> 01:03:44.737
Blaze. this is. uh...

1235
01:03:44.779 --> 01:03:46.239
This is Bonnie.

1236
01:03:46.280 --> 01:03:47.323
Hello. Bonnie.

1237
01:03:47.365 --> 01:03:49.367
Hi. Are these your toys?

1238
01:03:56.332 --> 01:03:58.376
I don't play
with toys anymore.

1239
01:03:58.417 --> 01:04:01.712
It's just they're antiques.

1240
01:04:04.131 --> 01:04:06.342
They do look pretty old.

1241
01:04:06.384 --> 01:04:08.719
Must be worth something
at least. right?

1242
01:04:10.805 --> 01:04:12.014
No. they're not.

1243
01:04:13.224 --> 01:04:14.517
You should keep 'em.

1244
01:04:18.312 --> 01:04:19.730
Oh. no.

1245
01:04:21.190 --> 01:04:23.109
Bonnie. you don't want them?

1246
01:04:28.364 --> 01:04:31.742
Are you sure?
Bonnie? Bonnie?

1247
01:04:32.660 --> 01:04:34.078
I don't know
what's come over her.

1248
01:04:34.120 --> 01:04:35.830
I'm so sorry
to have bothered you.

1249
01:04:35.872 --> 01:04:37.582
It's all right.

1250
01:04:37.623 --> 01:04:40.167
If you ever change your mind.
Bonnie. just let me know.

1251
01:04:50.052 --> 01:04:51.178
I don't get it.
What just happened?

1252
01:04:51.220 --> 01:04:52.722
What is going on. Bonnie?

1253
01:04:53.890 --> 01:04:55.182
Okay. I guess we're going.

1254
01:05:17.121 --> 01:05:19.790
Come on. Bullseye! Quick!
Before they drive away!

1255
01:05:21.751 --> 01:05:23.252
It's... It's too late for me.

1256
01:05:23.294 --> 01:05:25.254
Bullseye.
but maybe not for you.

1257
01:05:25.296 --> 01:05:26.923
Please. not for you.

1258
01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:37.224
-Sheriff?
-Jessie? A-Are you okay?

1259
01:05:37.266 --> 01:05:38.726
W-What just happened?

1260
01:05:38.768 --> 01:05:40.311
She ditched you. Jessie.

1261
01:05:40.353 --> 01:05:41.938
Because of you!

1262
01:05:41.979 --> 01:05:44.273
Because of all you
darn devices

1263
01:05:44.315 --> 01:05:46.150
making kids act older.

1264
01:05:46.192 --> 01:05:48.194
You stole all our time.

1265
01:05:48.235 --> 01:05:51.072
I wanted to make a difference.
I needed to make a difference.

1266
01:05:51.113 --> 01:05:52.490
And you ruined it.

1267
01:05:52.531 --> 01:05:54.033
Ow.

1268
01:05:54.075 --> 01:05:56.118
-Smarty. you okay?
-I'm-I'm sorry.

1269
01:05:56.160 --> 01:05:59.038
- Are you hurt? Did you crack?
- I'm fine. I'm fine.

1270
01:05:59.080 --> 01:06:01.207
For a rag doll. you throw
quite a punch. cowgir...

1271
01:06:02.041 --> 01:06:03.459
Cowgirl?

1272
01:06:06.504 --> 01:06:07.588
Jessie?

1273
01:06:17.390 --> 01:06:19.100
Uh. Sheriff?

1274
01:06:19.141 --> 01:06:20.851
I'm sorry. Smarty.

1275
01:06:20.893 --> 01:06:22.144
It's not you.

1276
01:06:23.020 --> 01:06:25.189
I'm the one that's useless.

1277
01:06:37.618 --> 01:06:38.953
Bullseye!

1278
01:06:41.455 --> 01:06:44.083
Poor Jessie.
Gotta find a way in.

1279
01:06:45.418 --> 01:06:48.087
Buzz. Buzz.
where are you going?

1280
01:06:48.129 --> 01:06:50.172
Let's talk about this.

1281
01:06:50.214 --> 01:06:51.966
Huh?

1282
01:06:53.759 --> 01:06:56.345
Uh. what... what is going on?

1283
01:06:56.387 --> 01:06:57.847
- State your name.
- Whoa. whoa.

1284
01:06:57.888 --> 01:06:59.724
- And your purpose.
- Hey. guys.

1285
01:06:59.765 --> 01:07:01.517
-Take him in.
-Guys! Whoa!

1286
01:07:03.978 --> 01:07:04.979
Wait. wait. What's going on?

1287
01:07:05.021 --> 01:07:06.689
My poncho!

1288
01:07:07.189 --> 01:07:08.566
Quiet. assassin!

1289
01:07:08.607 --> 01:07:10.985
Assassin?
No. I can't...

1290
01:07:12.194 --> 01:07:13.738
Buzz?

1291
01:07:13.779 --> 01:07:15.865
How do you know who we are?
Who sent you?

1292
01:07:15.906 --> 01:07:18.117
Oh. geez! What... I...

1293
01:07:18.159 --> 01:07:20.244
Talk!

1294
01:07:20.286 --> 01:07:22.079
Talk about what?

1295
01:07:22.121 --> 01:07:24.165
-What am I supposed to know?
-You bear a holster.

1296
01:07:24.206 --> 01:07:27.168
You were positioned outside
our leader's stronghold.

1297
01:07:27.209 --> 01:07:29.003
You are an agent of Zurg!

1298
01:07:29.045 --> 01:07:30.588
Zurg? No! Hey!

1299
01:07:30.629 --> 01:07:32.173
I don't even know
who your leader is!

1300
01:07:32.214 --> 01:07:34.717
Liar! You wish to harm
the red-haired maiden

1301
01:07:34.759 --> 01:07:36.218
who bears the mark
of Star Command.

1302
01:07:36.260 --> 01:07:37.511
- Jessie.
- No.

1303
01:07:37.553 --> 01:07:39.263
Wait!

1304
01:07:39.305 --> 01:07:41.390
He is not an agent of Zurg.

1305
01:07:42.850 --> 01:07:44.185
Well. then.
who's this old man?

1306
01:07:44.226 --> 01:07:45.853
Why do people
keep saying that?

1307
01:07:45.895 --> 01:07:46.896
I'm not that old!

1308
01:07:46.937 --> 01:07:49.815
This old man is a toy.

1309
01:07:49.857 --> 01:07:51.692
Hmm. A toy?

1310
01:07:52.318 --> 01:07:54.695
Yes. We are all toys!

1311
01:07:54.737 --> 01:07:56.447
Toy...

1312
01:07:56.489 --> 01:07:58.866
Our mission on this planet is
to make a child happy.

1313
01:07:58.908 --> 01:07:59.992
I've been dreaming about that.

1314
01:08:00.034 --> 01:08:01.202
You know what I mean?

1315
01:08:01.243 --> 01:08:03.370
- To play!
- To play. Play.

1316
01:08:03.412 --> 01:08:04.747
Hey! Buzz. can you help me...

1317
01:08:04.789 --> 01:08:06.499
...get out
of the mouth of this pig?

1318
01:08:06.540 --> 01:08:09.960
Search your feelings. Buzz.
You know it to be true!

1319
01:08:12.630 --> 01:08:15.883
And the red-haired maiden
you seek is our toy leader.

1320
01:08:15.925 --> 01:08:17.885
Her name is Sheriff Jessie.

1321
01:08:17.927 --> 01:08:19.512
Sheriff Jessie.

1322
01:08:19.553 --> 01:08:22.223
Sheriff Jessie is trapped
inside that stronghold.

1323
01:08:22.264 --> 01:08:24.433
We must infiltrate it
and rescue her

1324
01:08:24.475 --> 01:08:25.684
and her trusty steed.

1325
01:08:25.726 --> 01:08:27.019
How do you know all this?

1326
01:08:27.686 --> 01:08:30.064
Because I am her deputy.

1327
01:08:31.607 --> 01:08:33.025
Star Command.

1328
01:08:33.067 --> 01:08:36.237
Then this old man is a toy?

1329
01:08:36.278 --> 01:08:38.114
This pig has bad breath!

1330
01:08:38.155 --> 01:08:39.532
Oh. yeah. him.

1331
01:08:39.573 --> 01:08:41.408
He's my sidekick.
You can untie him.

1332
01:08:41.450 --> 01:08:45.329
And by the way. everybody.
Zurg is our dad.

1333
01:08:45.371 --> 01:08:48.499
- No! No!
- Yeah.

1334
01:08:55.631 --> 01:08:57.883
Hey. What's on your mind?

1335
01:08:57.925 --> 01:08:59.093
I don't know.

1336
01:08:59.135 --> 01:09:00.678
I just hope that girl's okay.

1337
01:09:00.719 --> 01:09:03.305
Aw.
She'll be fine. sweetie.

1338
01:09:03.347 --> 01:09:04.515
Don't you worry.

1339
01:09:04.557 --> 01:09:06.767
Hey. guys! Is anyone hungry?

1340
01:09:06.809 --> 01:09:08.227
- Me. me!
- Starving!

1341
01:09:08.269 --> 01:09:10.187
Can we get
Pasta Prairie. Baba?

1342
01:09:10.229 --> 01:09:12.356
Ooh. I like
the way you think. anushikes .

1343
01:09:14.525 --> 01:09:16.777
Spread out.

1344
01:09:17.444 --> 01:09:18.571
Not here.

1345
01:09:19.113 --> 01:09:20.406
Not here.

1346
01:09:20.447 --> 01:09:21.490
Definitely not here.

1347
01:09:22.283 --> 01:09:23.909
Blast! Where could she be?

1348
01:09:23.951 --> 01:09:26.412
Commander! We found
these electronic devices.

1349
01:09:26.453 --> 01:09:29.540
Hey. Micro-Chippendales!
Hands off.

1350
01:09:29.582 --> 01:09:31.333
Whoa!

1351
01:09:31.375 --> 01:09:33.377
I'm getting a major signal
from all you dudes.

1352
01:09:33.419 --> 01:09:36.255
-I've got full bars.
-Me too. I can map for miles!

1353
01:09:36.297 --> 01:09:38.174
These guys
are their own hot spot.

1354
01:09:39.675 --> 01:09:40.968
Oh. no. They're one of them.

1355
01:09:41.010 --> 01:09:43.762
They're one of us! Nice.

1356
01:09:43.804 --> 01:09:45.264
Hey. uh. this one's broken.
by the way.

1357
01:09:45.306 --> 01:09:47.057
Where are you hiding Jessie.
you machine?

1358
01:09:47.099 --> 01:09:48.642
Hey. hey. Easy there.

1359
01:09:48.684 --> 01:09:50.269
-Yeah!
-We're Jessie's friends!

1360
01:09:50.311 --> 01:09:52.771
And I have a name.
It's Smarty Pants.

1361
01:09:52.813 --> 01:09:54.023
Hygiene instructor.

1362
01:09:54.064 --> 01:09:55.232
He'll wipe your--

1363
01:09:55.274 --> 01:09:57.318
This is serious. Mr. Pants.

1364
01:09:57.359 --> 01:09:59.278
It is my sworn duty
as a Space Ranger--

1365
01:09:59.320 --> 01:10:01.405
-Ha. ha. you said "doody."
-Why. you!

1366
01:10:01.447 --> 01:10:03.115
Clearly. we're all friends
with Jessie.

1367
01:10:03.157 --> 01:10:04.992
so can you just tell us
where she is?

1368
01:10:05.034 --> 01:10:06.493
She went
to the tire-swing hill!

1369
01:10:06.535 --> 01:10:07.912
It's at the far end
of the ranch.

1370
01:10:07.953 --> 01:10:09.455
Gonna take me forever
to waddle there.

1371
01:10:09.496 --> 01:10:12.041
Well. we'll need a way
to get there.

1372
01:10:12.082 --> 01:10:13.334
Commander Lightyear.

1373
01:10:15.461 --> 01:10:16.795
Oh. my.

1374
01:10:19.548 --> 01:10:20.841
Whoa.

1375
01:10:30.351 --> 01:10:33.020
Bonnie? Did something happen
with your friends?

1376
01:10:38.400 --> 01:10:39.443
Can you show me?

1377
01:10:41.070 --> 01:10:43.989
You're not in trouble. Bonnie.
I promise.

1378
01:10:52.831 --> 01:10:54.625
Oh. sweetie.

1379
01:10:54.667 --> 01:10:58.087
You know that you can always
talk with me and Dad. right?

1380
01:10:58.587 --> 01:11:00.422
About anything.

1381
01:11:00.464 --> 01:11:03.509
Because we love you.
Bonnie. so much.

1382
01:11:04.593 --> 01:11:08.013
I wouldn't change
a single thing about you.

1383
01:11:08.055 --> 01:11:10.933
And I think a real friend
would feel the same.

1384
01:11:10.975 --> 01:11:12.017
Don't you?

1385
01:11:13.310 --> 01:11:14.645
But how about we take a break

1386
01:11:14.687 --> 01:11:16.438
from the group chat
for now. Okay?

1387
01:11:17.147 --> 01:11:18.399
Let's get some ice cream.

1388
01:11:27.574 --> 01:11:29.285
Trust me.
you're gonna love it.

1389
01:11:30.494 --> 01:11:31.745
- Cool!
- Sure.

1390
01:11:43.382 --> 01:11:46.093
Bonnie. they don't have
chocolate chip.

1391
01:11:46.135 --> 01:11:47.761
Come pick another flavor.

1392
01:12:09.366 --> 01:12:12.161
Mom. where's Lilypad?

1393
01:12:12.202 --> 01:12:13.954
I'm sorry. Bonnie.

1394
01:12:34.641 --> 01:12:36.101
What is it?

1395
01:12:39.646 --> 01:12:40.981
Bullseye.

1396
01:12:41.023 --> 01:12:42.608
You shouldn't have
followed me.

1397
01:12:42.649 --> 01:12:45.277
Oh. bad horse.

1398
01:12:49.406 --> 01:12:52.326
You go back to Blaze's.
Bullseye. You're better off.

1399
01:12:54.578 --> 01:12:58.040
I'm serious.
She'll take good care of you.

1400
01:12:58.082 --> 01:12:59.583
And all those horses...

1401
01:13:03.295 --> 01:13:05.339
Bullseye. no.

1402
01:13:05.381 --> 01:13:07.049
I'm not going with you.

1403
01:13:07.549 --> 01:13:09.218
I...

1404
01:13:09.259 --> 01:13:11.387
can't do this again.

1405
01:13:11.428 --> 01:13:12.471
I can't...

1406
01:13:13.597 --> 01:13:15.224
love another kid

1407
01:13:15.265 --> 01:13:17.976
just to find out
I never mattered.

1408
01:13:19.645 --> 01:13:20.521
I...

1409
01:13:21.271 --> 01:13:22.940
I can't.

1410
01:13:40.833 --> 01:13:43.544
I didn't write that.

1411
01:13:44.378 --> 01:13:45.921
It must have been...

1412
01:14:02.438 --> 01:14:03.647
Emily?

1413
01:14:06.525 --> 01:14:09.069
Daffodil. dig.

1414
01:14:26.044 --> 01:14:27.129
Wait.

1415
01:14:28.338 --> 01:14:30.466
This ain't stuff from Emily.

1416
01:14:30.507 --> 01:14:31.550
It...

1417
01:14:32.134 --> 01:14:33.302
It's newer.

1418
01:14:35.971 --> 01:14:37.347
It doesn't make any sense.

1419
01:14:37.389 --> 01:14:39.391
She wouldn't have
any of this stuff.

1420
01:14:39.433 --> 01:14:40.976
She'd be...

1421
01:14:44.271 --> 01:14:46.064
all grown-up.

1422
01:14:49.485 --> 01:14:50.527
Wait.

1423
01:14:57.326 --> 01:15:00.162
Emily named her daughter...

1424
01:15:04.041 --> 01:15:05.501
after me.

1425
01:15:15.302 --> 01:15:16.678
Really?

1426
01:15:32.319 --> 01:15:33.695
Uh...

1427
01:15:33.737 --> 01:15:35.656
Whoa!

1428
01:15:40.285 --> 01:15:42.037
Jessie? Bullseye!

1429
01:15:42.079 --> 01:15:42.955
Hey. I found 'em!

1430
01:15:42.996 --> 01:15:44.081
Woody?

1431
01:15:44.998 --> 01:15:46.750
-Buzz!
-Jessie!

1432
01:15:47.751 --> 01:15:48.961
You're okay.

1433
01:15:49.002 --> 01:15:50.963
What...
What are you doing here?

1434
01:15:51.004 --> 01:15:52.589
We came for you. Jessie.

1435
01:15:52.631 --> 01:15:53.715
For me?

1436
01:15:53.757 --> 01:15:55.259
We all did.

1437
01:16:03.934 --> 01:16:06.853
Well. howdy-do. Sheriff?

1438
01:16:06.895 --> 01:16:08.480
We come bearing Buzzes.

1439
01:16:08.522 --> 01:16:10.691
Looks like 50 to me.
but I can only count to two.

1440
01:16:13.026 --> 01:16:15.404
Star Command. Star Command.
Star Command. Star Command.

1441
01:16:15.445 --> 01:16:17.489
Star Command.
Star Command. Star Command.

1442
01:16:18.031 --> 01:16:19.408
Star Command.

1443
01:16:19.449 --> 01:16:21.535
All right.
all right. calm down.

1444
01:16:21.577 --> 01:16:22.744
Give her some room. fellas.

1445
01:16:22.786 --> 01:16:24.788
-Uh. Buzz.
-Yes?

1446
01:16:24.830 --> 01:16:28.041
Hey. hey. she meant that
for me. Just me.

1447
01:16:28.083 --> 01:16:30.377
-We saw Bonnie give you away.
-You did?

1448
01:16:30.419 --> 01:16:31.878
It doesn't make any sense.

1449
01:16:31.920 --> 01:16:33.213
You're not useless. Sheriff!

1450
01:16:33.255 --> 01:16:35.299
-We love you!
-So much!

1451
01:16:43.181 --> 01:16:44.600
Look. I'm okay.

1452
01:16:45.225 --> 01:16:47.978
Bonnie's growing up.

1453
01:16:49.187 --> 01:16:54.276
And we don't get to decide
when and how that happens.

1454
01:16:55.485 --> 01:16:56.945
All that matters is

1455
01:16:56.987 --> 01:16:58.989
we were there
at the right time

1456
01:16:59.031 --> 01:17:00.741
to help her along.

1457
01:17:07.581 --> 01:17:09.708
And I gotta believe we were.

1458
01:17:10.834 --> 01:17:12.919
You make us proud to be toys.
Jessie.

1459
01:17:12.961 --> 01:17:14.546
What are you doing? Stop!

1460
01:17:14.588 --> 01:17:16.632
Sorry. guys. Sorry.

1461
01:17:18.342 --> 01:17:20.719
Just wish she had at least
connected with Blaze.

1462
01:17:21.637 --> 01:17:23.263
Wait.

1463
01:17:23.305 --> 01:17:25.182
Connect! They still can!

1464
01:17:25.223 --> 01:17:26.767
Lilypad can do that!

1465
01:17:26.808 --> 01:17:28.101
-Lilypad?
-Lilypad?

1466
01:17:36.526 --> 01:17:38.236
Okay. okay.
Guys. message coming through.

1467
01:17:38.278 --> 01:17:40.238
"Jessie. I'm so sorry.

1468
01:17:40.280 --> 01:17:42.324
Chose wrong friends.
Hurt Bonnie."

1469
01:17:42.366 --> 01:17:43.742
-Oh. no.
-Bonnie.

1470
01:17:43.784 --> 01:17:46.161
Smarty. send a reply.
"You can fix it."

1471
01:17:51.541 --> 01:17:54.211
"No. I can't.
Threw myself away."

1472
01:17:54.252 --> 01:17:56.004
-What?
-"On donation truck."

1473
01:17:56.046 --> 01:17:59.341
Jumpin' Jehoshaphat!
Now she throws herself away?

1474
01:17:59.383 --> 01:18:01.218
We're goin' after her.

1475
01:18:01.259 --> 01:18:02.761
-What?
-But how?

1476
01:18:02.803 --> 01:18:05.931
Smarty. tell Lily to send
a photo of where she is.

1477
01:18:06.640 --> 01:18:08.058
Got it.

1478
01:18:08.100 --> 01:18:09.643
Snappy. zoom in
on that blurry road sign.

1479
01:18:09.685 --> 01:18:11.520
Look at you
with that tech talk. cowgirl.

1480
01:18:11.561 --> 01:18:12.896
Martin Avenue.

1481
01:18:12.938 --> 01:18:14.356
Atlas. can you get us
to that truck?

1482
01:18:14.398 --> 01:18:16.274
Already mapped it.
cowboy lady.

1483
01:18:16.316 --> 01:18:18.652
Tell Lily to keep sending
photos of where she is.

1484
01:18:18.694 --> 01:18:20.070
We're getting her back.

1485
01:18:20.112 --> 01:18:21.488
Yes. Sheriff.

1486
01:18:21.530 --> 01:18:23.115
Jessie. when you have
a moment.

1487
01:18:23.156 --> 01:18:24.741
there's something
you'd like to ask me...

1488
01:18:24.783 --> 01:18:26.535
-I'd like to ask you.
-Sure thing. Deputy.

1489
01:18:26.576 --> 01:18:28.578
-Now. a little help?
-Yes. Sheriff.

1490
01:18:29.746 --> 01:18:31.540
Yeehaw!

1491
01:18:31.581 --> 01:18:33.083
Let's ride.

1492
01:18:34.459 --> 01:18:36.253
Whoa! Hey!

1493
01:18:38.797 --> 01:18:40.549
-Hey! Hey. wait for us!
-Hey! Wait for us!

1494
01:18:54.354 --> 01:18:56.189
She's not far.

1495
01:18:56.231 --> 01:18:59.151
If we go south five blocks.
then east for two.

1496
01:18:59.192 --> 01:19:00.360
we might be able
to head 'em off

1497
01:19:00.402 --> 01:19:01.069
before they reach
the highway.

1498
01:19:01.111 --> 01:19:02.154
Car!

1499
01:19:05.490 --> 01:19:07.617
Clear!

1500
01:19:07.659 --> 01:19:08.910
She just passed a gas station.

1501
01:19:08.952 --> 01:19:11.163
Passed gas. Sorry. had to.

1502
01:19:11.204 --> 01:19:12.789
We're close. Take a shortcut.

1503
01:19:12.831 --> 01:19:14.207
Down this next road
to the right.

1504
01:19:19.379 --> 01:19:20.922
It's a house!

1505
01:19:20.964 --> 01:19:22.424
I don't get it.
There should be a road.

1506
01:19:22.466 --> 01:19:24.176
Probably was a road
five years ago. Old map.

1507
01:19:24.217 --> 01:19:26.344
-Recalculating.
-No time. We're going through.

1508
01:19:26.386 --> 01:19:27.971
- Wait. what?
- Going through?

1509
01:19:36.730 --> 01:19:37.731
Down. boy. down!

1510
01:19:39.775 --> 01:19:41.443
Whoa. whoa.

1511
01:19:45.113 --> 01:19:46.490
Yeehaw!

1512
01:19:57.000 --> 01:20:00.045
The truck. I see it up ahead.

1513
01:20:01.588 --> 01:20:02.881
Follow me.

1514
01:20:02.923 --> 01:20:04.049
Yes. Sheriff.

1515
01:20:12.974 --> 01:20:14.184
Whoo!

1516
01:20:14.226 --> 01:20:15.936
We have reached
our destination.

1517
01:20:15.977 --> 01:20:17.354
-Lily?
-Lily!

1518
01:20:17.395 --> 01:20:19.105
- Lily. where are ya?
- Lily!

1519
01:20:19.147 --> 01:20:20.690
- Lily?
- Lilypad. where you at?

1520
01:20:20.732 --> 01:20:21.983
Hey. Lily.

1521
01:20:22.025 --> 01:20:23.318
Yes. can I help you?

1522
01:20:24.820 --> 01:20:27.781
Lily. It's okay. We got ya.

1523
01:20:27.823 --> 01:20:29.282
You shouldn't have come.
Jessie.

1524
01:20:29.324 --> 01:20:31.159
Nuh-uh. No time
for pity parties. Lily.

1525
01:20:31.243 --> 01:20:33.411
Bonnie still needs you
to make a friend.

1526
01:20:33.453 --> 01:20:35.372
Me? But I...

1527
01:20:35.413 --> 01:20:38.750
I made a major miscalculation
with Kara. Chelsea and Heidi.

1528
01:20:38.792 --> 01:20:40.669
You were right.
Bonnie's different.

1529
01:20:40.710 --> 01:20:41.628
She deserves better.

1530
01:20:41.670 --> 01:20:43.421
Lily.

1531
01:20:43.463 --> 01:20:45.131
You didn't know those girls
were wrong for Bonnie.

1532
01:20:45.173 --> 01:20:47.092
No. I'm wrong for Bonnie.

1533
01:20:47.133 --> 01:20:49.761
-I'm the one who caused this.
-Well. then help me fix it.

1534
01:20:49.803 --> 01:20:52.013
I found Bonnie
the right friend.

1535
01:20:52.055 --> 01:20:53.390
-You did?
-Yep.

1536
01:20:53.431 --> 01:20:55.475
So. how about you and me
connect them?

1537
01:20:55.517 --> 01:20:57.394
Uh... Okay.

1538
01:20:57.435 --> 01:20:59.604
But first. we gotta get
everyone off this truck

1539
01:20:59.646 --> 01:21:00.730
and back home.

1540
01:21:05.694 --> 01:21:08.321
Uh. we are moving way too fast
to get off now.

1541
01:21:08.363 --> 01:21:10.824
And we're going farther away
by the second.

1542
01:21:10.866 --> 01:21:12.826
There's gotta be
something we can do.

1543
01:21:12.868 --> 01:21:15.036
We've got all these
fancy Buzzes.

1544
01:21:17.747 --> 01:21:19.499
Excuse me.
Move. move. Out of the way.

1545
01:21:19.541 --> 01:21:20.834
Spaceman. turn around.

1546
01:21:29.009 --> 01:21:31.469
- Snap!
- Yes. yes. yes. yes!

1547
01:21:31.511 --> 01:21:32.846
No way.

1548
01:21:32.888 --> 01:21:34.890
Oh. yeah. Way.

1549
01:21:39.603 --> 01:21:40.812
Ready. Sheriff?

1550
01:21:40.854 --> 01:21:42.105
Punch it. Lily.

1551
01:21:56.536 --> 01:21:58.413
Whoa.

1552
01:21:58.455 --> 01:22:00.582
Fly. Be free!

1553
01:22:00.624 --> 01:22:01.666
Show-offs!

1554
01:22:09.341 --> 01:22:11.134
Wow.

1555
01:22:11.176 --> 01:22:12.636
Whoo-hoo!

1556
01:22:13.178 --> 01:22:14.554
-Whoo!
-Whoo!

1557
01:22:16.222 --> 01:22:18.266
Now. this is flying.

1558
01:22:18.308 --> 01:22:19.476
With style!

1559
01:22:19.517 --> 01:22:22.228
Yeehaw!

1560
01:22:27.484 --> 01:22:29.194
So. we're clear on the plan?

1561
01:22:29.235 --> 01:22:31.112
Once you're at Bonnie's.
you send the message.

1562
01:22:31.154 --> 01:22:33.114
Blaze brings me and Bullseye
to the house.

1563
01:22:33.156 --> 01:22:35.492
and this time. they connect!

1564
01:22:35.533 --> 01:22:37.702
Jessie. wait. What if Bonnie
rejects you again?

1565
01:22:37.744 --> 01:22:40.413
If they become friends.
it's all worth it.

1566
01:22:40.455 --> 01:22:41.998
Yes. Sheriff.

1567
01:22:43.083 --> 01:22:46.086
Huh? Wait. Jessie. wait!

1568
01:22:46.127 --> 01:22:47.253
What?

1569
01:22:48.713 --> 01:22:49.923
What is it. Buzz?

1570
01:22:49.965 --> 01:22:51.675
Just listen to me.

1571
01:22:51.716 --> 01:22:53.176
I... I've been trying
to ask you this. and if...

1572
01:22:53.218 --> 01:22:55.637
if I don't do it now.
I never will.

1573
01:22:55.679 --> 01:22:58.139
Will you...

1574
01:22:58.181 --> 01:23:00.433
Buzz. you can do this.

1575
01:23:00.475 --> 01:23:01.851
Will... Will...

1576
01:23:07.941 --> 01:23:10.318
You're stuck with me. Deputy.

1577
01:23:15.991 --> 01:23:17.909
Cheer up. boys.
She'll be back.

1578
01:23:17.951 --> 01:23:19.828
We have a plan!

1579
01:23:19.869 --> 01:23:22.539
At ease. Ranger. At ease.

1580
01:23:43.101 --> 01:23:44.602
Men. you know your mission.

1581
01:23:44.644 --> 01:23:45.645
Yes. Commander.

1582
01:23:50.233 --> 01:23:51.526
Woody! Buzz!

1583
01:23:51.568 --> 01:23:53.028
- What?
- Lily!

1584
01:23:53.069 --> 01:23:54.529
-Oh. no. no. no.
-Foul device.

1585
01:23:54.571 --> 01:23:56.031
What's she doing here?

1586
01:23:56.072 --> 01:23:57.407
She's one of us. guys.
Deal with it.

1587
01:23:57.449 --> 01:23:58.992
Listen up. everyone.

1588
01:23:59.034 --> 01:24:00.702
Lily and Jessie
have a plan to help Bonnie.

1589
01:24:00.744 --> 01:24:02.537
Okay.
what do you need us to do?

1590
01:24:02.579 --> 01:24:03.705
Nothing.

1591
01:24:03.747 --> 01:24:05.373
-Nothing?
-That's easy.

1592
01:24:05.415 --> 01:24:07.083
Jessie already did
the hard work.

1593
01:24:07.125 --> 01:24:08.793
Classic Jessica.

1594
01:24:08.835 --> 01:24:11.379
All that's left for me
is to send a message.

1595
01:24:29.355 --> 01:24:31.149
It's up to the girls now.

1596
01:24:51.920 --> 01:24:54.464
Hey. sweetie.
Look what I found in the car.

1597
01:24:56.007 --> 01:24:57.634
It's okay.
We turned off the chat.

1598
01:25:14.359 --> 01:25:16.736
Bonnie.
You have a friend at the door.

1599
01:25:18.738 --> 01:25:20.323
- Let's try to beat...
- Hi. Bonnie.

1600
01:25:20.365 --> 01:25:22.242
- ...our high score.
-I brought your dolls.

1601
01:25:23.952 --> 01:25:25.703
Bonnie. come say hi.

1602
01:25:25.745 --> 01:25:26.830
Okay.

1603
01:25:35.380 --> 01:25:36.464
Hi.

1604
01:25:37.257 --> 01:25:38.299
Hi.

1605
01:25:46.015 --> 01:25:47.934
I'm sorry.
I don't play with toys--

1606
01:25:47.976 --> 01:25:49.686
I played with her
a little yesterday.

1607
01:25:50.478 --> 01:25:52.021
I like it when she's like.

1608
01:25:52.063 --> 01:25:54.023
"I ain't afraid of nothin'.
partner."

1609
01:26:00.697 --> 01:26:02.782
That... That was weird.

1610
01:26:03.241 --> 01:26:04.826
Uh... I...

1611
01:26:05.451 --> 01:26:06.578
Sorry I bothered you.

1612
01:26:11.541 --> 01:26:13.209
-Oh. no. Don't go.
-No. no. no.

1613
01:26:13.251 --> 01:26:14.669
-She can't go. She can't go.
-No. no. no. no.

1614
01:26:16.546 --> 01:26:17.630
Blaze!

1615
01:26:31.144 --> 01:26:34.272
I like your boots.

1616
01:26:37.817 --> 01:26:40.111
I... I really like your socks.

1617
01:26:42.780 --> 01:26:45.617
Do you like my beard. madame?

1618
01:26:46.284 --> 01:26:48.953
Very impressive. m'lady.

1619
01:26:48.995 --> 01:26:51.664
Yes.
I'm one billion years old.

1620
01:26:51.706 --> 01:26:53.750
That's why it's so glorious.

1621
01:27:01.424 --> 01:27:02.717
Um...

1622
01:27:02.759 --> 01:27:04.385
Do you wanna play?

1623
01:27:06.763 --> 01:27:07.805
Okay.

1624
01:27:08.848 --> 01:27:10.225
-Walter. let's go.
-Okay. Okay.

1625
01:27:10.266 --> 01:27:12.101
-Do you actually have a horse?
-Yeah.

1626
01:27:12.143 --> 01:27:13.603
Like. a real one?

1627
01:27:13.645 --> 01:27:15.230
Yes! It's real.

1628
01:27:17.857 --> 01:27:20.401
Hey. I have an idea.

1629
01:27:30.912 --> 01:27:32.538
Look at that kilt.

1630
01:27:43.258 --> 01:27:45.802
Please. take care of my son.

1631
01:27:50.765 --> 01:27:53.810
Friends.
we are gathered here today

1632
01:27:53.851 --> 01:27:57.105
to witness
the most wonderfulest union

1633
01:27:57.146 --> 01:27:58.523
of Sheriff Jessie

1634
01:27:58.564 --> 01:28:01.276
and Buzz-tholomew
MacLightyear.

1635
01:28:09.367 --> 01:28:11.119
Now. Sheriff.

1636
01:28:11.160 --> 01:28:14.497
please put this ring
onto Buzz's itty-bitty finger

1637
01:28:14.539 --> 01:28:16.374
and make your vows.

1638
01:28:17.834 --> 01:28:20.378
Buzz. will you take this ring

1639
01:28:20.420 --> 01:28:22.088
as my pinky promise

1640
01:28:22.130 --> 01:28:25.133
to have fun.
and play with you and stuff.

1641
01:28:25.174 --> 01:28:27.093
for all my days.

1642
01:28:27.135 --> 01:28:29.137
even the hard ones?

1643
01:28:29.178 --> 01:28:31.764
- I do--
- Bonnie...

1644
01:28:31.806 --> 01:28:33.308
have you seen my wedding ring?

1645
01:28:34.475 --> 01:28:35.601
Uh...

1646
01:28:35.643 --> 01:28:37.645
Maybe check the bathroom?

1647
01:28:37.687 --> 01:28:38.980
Wait. wait. wait.
We need. like...

1648
01:28:39.022 --> 01:28:40.231
Flowers! From the garden.

1649
01:28:40.273 --> 01:28:42.317
-Good idea.
-Follow me.

1650
01:28:42.358 --> 01:28:44.485
And there's confetti
in the craft drawer.

1651
01:28:45.570 --> 01:28:47.030
Oh. congrats. you two.

1652
01:28:47.071 --> 01:28:48.448
Don't worry.
I took plenty of photos

1653
01:28:48.489 --> 01:28:49.907
for Smarty and the gang.

1654
01:28:49.949 --> 01:28:52.368
That's really sweet of you.
Lily.

1655
01:28:53.995 --> 01:28:54.912
Mmm.

1656
01:28:55.580 --> 01:28:57.040
You done good. Sheriff.

1657
01:28:57.790 --> 01:28:59.625
You can call me Jessica.

1658
01:29:00.251 --> 01:29:01.878
Okay. I will. Jessica.

1659
01:29:02.587 --> 01:29:04.088
Actually. no. No.

1660
01:29:04.130 --> 01:29:05.173
Okay.

1661
01:29:06.382 --> 01:29:07.842
Hey. when you get a chance.

1662
01:29:07.884 --> 01:29:10.136
can you introduce me
to the ring bearer?

1663
01:29:10.178 --> 01:29:11.804
-Oh.
-Awooga.

1664
01:29:11.846 --> 01:29:12.930
Okay.

1665
01:29:12.972 --> 01:29:14.098
They're coming.

1666
01:29:14.974 --> 01:29:16.392
I got it. That's awesome.

1667
01:29:16.434 --> 01:29:17.852
That's such a good idea.

1668
01:29:17.894 --> 01:29:19.687
The wedding is on.

1669
01:29:19.729 --> 01:29:20.772
Okay!

1670
01:29:20.813 --> 01:29:22.357
- Buzz...
- Buzz.

1671
01:29:22.398 --> 01:29:25.234
do you take me as
your super cool. sheriff wife?

1672
01:29:25.276 --> 01:29:26.652
I do.

1673
01:29:26.694 --> 01:29:28.112
And do you take me as
your handsome.

1674
01:29:28.154 --> 01:29:30.406
Space Ranger husband?

1675
01:29:30.907 --> 01:29:32.492
Oh.

1676
01:29:33.201 --> 01:29:34.452
I do.

1677
01:29:35.161 --> 01:29:37.246
Then I now pronounce you--

1678
01:29:37.288 --> 01:29:39.165
I object!

1679
01:29:39.207 --> 01:29:40.124
Oh. no.

1680
01:29:40.917 --> 01:29:42.960
Buzz is already married...

1681
01:29:43.044 --> 01:29:44.087
to me!

1682
01:29:47.757 --> 01:29:51.135
This is the third time
this has happened to me!

1683
01:29:51.177 --> 01:29:52.595
How could you?

1684
01:29:52.637 --> 01:29:54.055
Slap.

1685
01:29:54.097 --> 01:29:56.349
Jessie.
it's not what you think.

1686
01:29:56.391 --> 01:29:59.227
Tell them. Buzz!
Tell them about our love!

1687
01:29:59.268 --> 01:30:01.229
But. Trixie. that was then...

1688
01:30:01.270 --> 01:30:03.773
...and this is now.

1689
01:30:04.482 --> 01:30:06.067
Protect the babies!

1690
01:30:06.109 --> 01:30:07.402
You'll hear from my lawyers
about this!

1691
01:30:07.443 --> 01:30:08.861
-This is an outrage.
-Tell them. Buzz.

1692
01:30:08.903 --> 01:30:11.572
-Congratulations.
-You got this. Deputy.

1693
01:30:12.657 --> 01:30:14.242
-So did you help?
-Yeah.

1694
01:30:14.283 --> 01:30:16.244
We just followed
Jessie's lead.

1695
01:30:16.285 --> 01:30:18.329
-Woody. will you...
-Um...

1696
01:30:18.371 --> 01:30:20.832
- ...hold these? I'll drive.
- Well...

1697
01:30:21.874 --> 01:30:23.000
Ooh. la la.

1698
01:30:26.963 --> 01:30:29.090
-Yes! Oh. look at them.
-They're glowing.

1699
01:30:29.132 --> 01:30:30.550
They're such good friends.

1700
01:30:30.591 --> 01:30:31.926
Okay. save that one.

1701
01:30:31.968 --> 01:30:33.302
-Fierce.
-Oh. my gosh. Yes!

1702
01:30:33.344 --> 01:30:34.762
Okay. Buzz with the kilt.

1703
01:30:34.804 --> 01:30:36.431
I'm moving
to Palm Springs.

1704
01:30:36.472 --> 01:30:38.099
What if Trixie
poisoned the wedding cake?

1705
01:30:38.141 --> 01:30:42.186
But. Trixie. why?

1706
01:30:42.228 --> 01:30:44.605
Hey. would you ever
wanna sleep over?

1707
01:30:44.647 --> 01:30:47.358
Yes! That'd be so fun.

1708
01:30:47.984 --> 01:30:49.110
Look. Look. look.

1709
01:30:51.237 --> 01:30:53.406
Friends forever. partner.

1710
01:30:53.448 --> 01:30:56.576
Come on. Jessie.
We'll take my spaceship.

1711
01:30:56.617 --> 01:30:58.619
-Where to first?
-Neptune!

1712
01:30:58.661 --> 01:30:59.829
What are you guys doing?

1713
01:30:59.871 --> 01:31:01.330
Honeymooning!

1714
01:31:01.372 --> 01:31:02.415
Wanna come?

1715
01:31:02.457 --> 01:31:05.001
-Sure!
-Wait. wait.

1716
01:31:05.042 --> 01:31:06.502
Look. Jessie. space dolphins!

1717
01:31:06.544 --> 01:31:07.587
Hi. dolphin.

1718
01:31:29.567 --> 01:31:31.777
♪ I knew you ♪

1719
01:31:31.944 --> 01:31:33.863
♪ Through the daze
Of the blades of the grass ♪

1720
01:31:33.905 --> 01:31:35.198
♪ In summer ♪

1721
01:31:35.239 --> 01:31:37.033
♪ Parachutes ♪

1722
01:31:37.074 --> 01:31:39.452
♪ For the free fall
Of being younger ♪

1723
01:31:39.494 --> 01:31:44.665
♪ I memorized the sound
Of your bare footsteps ♪

1724
01:31:45.708 --> 01:31:48.044
♪ Running wild ♪

1725
01:31:48.169 --> 01:31:49.504
♪ It's been a long time ♪

1726
01:31:50.880 --> 01:31:54.926
♪ Life has ways
Of leaving those days behind ♪

1727
01:31:55.885 --> 01:31:58.888
♪ But seeing you tonight ♪

1728
01:31:58.930 --> 01:32:00.848
♪ I remembered I loved you ♪

1729
01:32:00.890 --> 01:32:03.142
♪ Came back when it mattered
I saw you ♪

1730
01:32:03.184 --> 01:32:05.686
♪ Standing there
In the light of the window ♪

1731
01:32:05.728 --> 01:32:07.313
♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1732
01:32:07.355 --> 01:32:09.106
♪ Man. it's been a while ♪

1733
01:32:09.148 --> 01:32:10.858
♪ But I knew it. I knew you ♪

1734
01:32:13.236 --> 01:32:15.154
♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1735
01:32:16.072 --> 01:32:18.282
♪ I knew you ♪

1736
01:32:18.324 --> 01:32:20.076
♪ All your blues ♪

1737
01:32:20.117 --> 01:32:21.536
♪ Like a mood ring
Changing colors ♪

1738
01:32:21.577 --> 01:32:23.538
♪ You did too ♪

1739
01:32:23.579 --> 01:32:25.581
♪ There were times
We could fight like brothers ♪

1740
01:32:25.623 --> 01:32:30.336
♪ I watched you drive
Around the bend ♪

1741
01:32:30.378 --> 01:32:32.838
♪ For what
I thought would be ♪

1742
01:32:32.880 --> 01:32:37.009
♪ The last time
I saw my friend ♪

1743
01:32:37.051 --> 01:32:40.096
♪ But love has ways
Of bringing things back ♪

1744
01:32:40.137 --> 01:32:42.431
♪ To life ♪

1745
01:32:42.473 --> 01:32:45.226
♪ All you said was hi ♪

1746
01:32:45.268 --> 01:32:47.311
♪ And I remembered
I loved you ♪

1747
01:32:47.353 --> 01:32:49.730
♪ Came back when it mattered
I saw you ♪

1748
