1749
01:32:52.149 --> 01:32:53.776
♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1750
01:32:53.818 --> 01:32:55.736
♪ Man. it's been a while ♪

1751
01:32:55.778 --> 01:32:57.738
♪ But I knew it. I knew you ♪

1752
01:32:57.780 --> 01:32:58.656
♪ I knew ♪

1753
01:33:00.366 --> 01:33:03.995
-♪ I knew. I knew ♪
-♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1754
01:33:05.580 --> 01:33:07.999
-♪ I knew. I knew ♪
-♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1755
01:33:18.342 --> 01:33:20.845
♪ Oh the rivers I cried ♪

1756
01:33:20.886 --> 01:33:22.471
♪ When we said goodbye ♪

1757
01:33:23.764 --> 01:33:28.477
♪ Wondering if I'd made it up
In my mind ♪

1758
01:33:28.519 --> 01:33:31.856
♪ And now you looked me
In the eye ♪

1759
01:33:31.897 --> 01:33:33.816
♪ And you told me
I loved you ♪

1760
01:33:33.858 --> 01:33:36.277
♪ Came back when it mattered
I saw you ♪

1761
01:33:36.319 --> 01:33:38.696
♪ Standing there
In the light of the window ♪

1762
