♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1763
01:33:40.364 --> 01:33:42.033
♪ Yeah. it's been a while ♪

1764
01:33:43.784 --> 01:33:45.244
♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1765
01:33:45.286 --> 01:33:47.079
♪ Man. it's been a while ♪

1766
01:33:47.121 --> 01:33:48.914
♪ Been a while ♪

1767
01:33:48.956 --> 01:33:50.583
♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1768
