♪ Man. it's been a while ♪

1769
01:33:52.376 --> 01:33:54.378
♪ But I knew it. I knew you ♪

1770
01:33:54.420 --> 01:33:56.964
♪ I knew you ♪

1771
01:33:57.006 --> 01:33:59.592
-♪ I knew ♪
-♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1772
01:33:59.634 --> 01:34:01.802
♪ I knew you ♪

1773
