♪ Wearing that same smile ♪

1774
01:34:05.473 --> 01:34:07.642
♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1775
01:34:10.603 --> 01:34:12.355
♪ I knew it. I knew you ♪

1776
01:34:13.105 --> 01:34:14.148
♪ I knew it! ♪

1777
01:34:26.661 --> 01:34:27.703
Whoa!

1778
01:34:35.670 --> 01:34:36.837
Huh?

1779
01:34:45.137 --> 01:34:46.555
I am Buzz Lightyear.

1780
01:34:46.597 --> 01:34:48.599
To infinity and beyond!

1781
01:35:02.655 --> 01:35:04.699
Hey! You kids play nice. I--

1782
01:35:04.740 --> 01:35:05.783
Oh.

1783
01:35:10.329 --> 01:35:11.580
Mission accomplished.

1784
01:35:16.168 --> 01:35:18.587
We meet again. my son.

1785
01:35:18.629 --> 01:35:20.214
No!

1786
01:40:11.547 --> 01:40:14.008
-I don't know how to do this.
-Drop the beat.

1787
01:40:14.049 --> 01:40:16.051
- ♪ Hey ♪
- ♪ Me and the toys ♪

1788
01:40:16.093 --> 01:40:17.553
- ♪ Me and the toys ♪
- ♪ Make a friend ♪

1789
01:40:17.594 --> 01:40:19.346
- ♪ Toys ♪
-I can't do this.

1790
01:40:19.388 --> 01:40:21.181
♪ Try to get Bonnie
